All coding rules for this repository live in CLAUDE.md at the repo root.

Read CLAUDE.md before making any changes. It documents the two-system architecture (outbound caller in app/, cancellation backfill in backfill-backend/, shared frontend in frontend/), the hard boundaries between them (no cross-imports, separate databases, separate Alembic environments), and the dev commands for each system.

Do not duplicate or paraphrase those rules here — defer to CLAUDE.md as the single source of truth.
